      "raw_description": "Data Scientist Company: JobSPhere Location: Remote Employment Type: Full-Time Compensation: Performance-Based, up to ₹35,000/- ABOUT THE COMPANY JobSPhere is a technology-focused organization committed to developing innovative digital solutions through data, artificial intelligence, and modern technologies. We aim to help businesses solve complex challenges while encouraging innovation, learning, and technical excellence. ABOUT THE ROLE We are looking for a curious and analytical Data Science Intern who is passionate about exploring data, building predictive models, and solving real-world problems. In this role, you will work with datasets, apply statistical techniques, experiment with machine learning algorithms, and transform raw data into meaningful insights. KEY RESPONSIBILITIES Collect, process, clean, and organize large datasets. Develop and test machine learning models for predictive analysis. Perform exploratory data analysis to discover patterns and trends. Apply statistical methods to solve analytical problems. Create data visualizations, charts, and reports. Evaluate model performance and suggest improvements. Collaborate with team members on data science projects. Document findings and communicate insights effectively. ELIGIBILITY Pursuing or completed a degree in Data Science, Computer Science, Mathematics, Statistics, or a related field. Freshers and experienced candidates are welcome to apply. Strong interest in data science, artificial intelligence, and machine learning. Good logical reasoning and problem-solving abilities. REQUIRED SKILLS Python programming. Knowledge of Pandas and NumPy. Basic understanding of statistics and probability. Familiarity with machine learning algorithms. Basic knowledge of Scikit-learn. Understanding of data visualization techniques. Analytical thinking and attention to detail. PERKS & BENEFITS 💰 Performance-based compensation up to ₹35,000/-. 📊 Opportunity to work on practical data science projects. Hands-on exposure to machine learning and analytical tools. Opportunity to develop technical and research skills. Professional mentorship and learning opportunities. Exposure to real-world business challenges. Internship certificate upon successful completion. EQUAL OPPORTUNITY JobSPhere encourages applications from candidates with diverse backgrounds and experiences. We are committed to maintaining an inclusive, collaborative, and supportive environment where everyone gets an opportunity to learn, innovate, and grow.",
