      "description": "DATA ANALYST INTERN Company: Axentriax Location: Remote (Work From Home) – India Internship Type: Remote Internship Eligibility: College Students Only Turn Data Into Insights. Start Your Data Analytics Career! Are you interested in Data Analytics, Python, SQL, Microsoft Excel, an...",
      "raw_description": "DATA ANALYST INTERN Company: Axentriax Location: Remote (Work From Home) – India Internship Type: Remote Internship Eligibility: College Students Only Turn Data Into Insights. Start Your Data Analytics Career! Are you interested in Data Analytics, Python, SQL, Microsoft Excel, and Business Intelligence? Looking to gain practical experience in analyzing data, identifying patterns, and generating meaningful business insights? Axentriax is inviting enthusiastic college students to join its Remote Data Analyst Internship Program. Gain practical exposure to data collection, data cleaning, data preprocessing, exploratory data analysis, data visualization, dashboard development, and business reporting through hands-on projects and technical assignments. Freshers Welcome! No previous internship experience is required. What You'll Work On - Explore data analytics concepts and techniques using Python and Microsoft Excel. - Write SQL queries to retrieve, filter, join, and analyze datasets. - Perform data cleaning, preprocessing, and data validation. - Conduct Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) to identify trends, patterns, and relationships. - Work with Python libraries such as NumPy and Pandas. - Create meaningful visualizations using Matplotlib and Seaborn. - Develop interactive dashboards and reports using Power BI or Tableau. - Apply basic statistical concepts to interpret and analyze datasets. - Identify business trends and communicate data-driven insights. - Work on practical data analytics projects and technical assignments. Who Can Apply? - College students pursuing B.Tech, B.E., BCA, B.Sc., MCA, or related degrees. - Students interested in Data Analytics, Business Intelligence, and Data Science. - Basic knowledge of Microsoft Excel or Python is preferred. - Familiarity with SQL, statistics, or data visualization is an advantage, not mandatory. - Students with analytical thinking, curiosity, attention to detail, and problem-solving skills. Why Join Axentriax? - 100% Remote: Gain practical experience from anywhere in India. - Hands-On Projects: Apply your knowledge to practical data analytics problems. - Industry-Relevant Skills: Explore Python, SQL, Excel, Power BI, and Tableau. - Practical Exposure: Understand data cleaning, analysis, visualization, and reporting. - Career Development: Build a foundation for Data Analyst, Business Analyst, and Business Intelligence Analyst roles. Your Data Analytics Journey Starts Here! Whether you're beginning with Excel or exploring Python, SQL, and data visualization, this internship offers an opportunity to strengthen your analytical and technical skills through practical experience. Apply now and take your first step towards building a career in Data Analytics with Axentriax!",
